BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Davis Downtown": "https://davisdowntown.com/event/2nd-friday-artabout-july-receptions/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:davis_downtown
SUMMARY:2nd Friday ArtAbout – July Receptions
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T210000
UID:10001179-1783702800-1783717200@davisdowntown.com
DESCRIPTION:Experience Downtown Davis through art during the monthly 2nd 
 Friday ArtAbout! This free\, self-guided art walk invites you to explore l
 ocal galleries\, businesses\, and creative spaces featuring new exhibition
 s\, artist receptions\, live music\, and more. \n🗓 Friday\, July 10⏰
  5:00–9:00 PM (venue hours vary)📍 Downtown Davis \nFeatured Stops\
 nVisit 10+ participating venues throughout Downtown Davis for art receptio
 ns\, pop-ups\, open studios\, live music\, and more. \n🖼 The Paint Chi
 p (5:00–6:00 PM)Explore local artist Jessica Bergler’s vibrant exhi
 bit featuring natural landscapes inspired by local colors and brilliant li
 ghting. Meet the artist during her reception. \n🎭 Pamela Trokel Dance 
 Workshop (5:30–7:30 PM)Enjoy an immersive evening of visual art and dan
 ce with live performances\, artist interactions\, and hands-on creative ac
 tivities. \n🎨 Logos Books (6:00–8:00 PM)Meet artist Lorie Topinka
  at the reception for her watercolor paintings in Whimsy: Chickens of th
 e 5th Street Community Garden and Friends. \n🖼 Pence Gallery (6:00–
 9:00 PM)View several new exhibitions\, enjoy complimentary wine\, and take
  part in an art-themed scavenger hunt during the opening reception. Curren
 t exhibits include Slice: A Juried Exhibit of Regional Art\, Mithril Vis
 ion: Earth Stars\, Exhibit It! A Community Art Exhibit\, and David Burkh
 art: Day Trip. \n✨ Admission is free\, and many venues offer compliment
 ary refreshments. Whether you’re an art enthusiast or simply looking for
  a fun evening downtown\, ArtAbout is the perfect way to celebrate Davis
 ’ vibrant creative community.
URL:https://davisdowntown.com/event/2nd-friday-artabout-july-receptions/
X-SOURCE:Davis Downtown
END:VEVENT
