 81%29_20260512194621518418.png
DESCRIPTION:Indivisible Yolo invites you to a showing of Vigilantes\, a do
 cumentary about the unending battle for voting rights. The fight to protec
 t voting rights never ends\, and right now\, we’re witnessing a Jim-Crow
 -era effort from politicians and their billionaire friends to restrict our
  freedoms\, silence our voices\, and consolidate power. But in America\, w
 e choose our leaders. We will decide our future. The same spirit that fuel
 ed Selma\, Montgomery\, and the March on Washington lives on in our unifie
 d ac
