 ploads/event/Good%20Trouble%20071726_20260703172848461388_2026070400170886
 5556.jpeg
DESCRIPTION:Join Indivisible Yolo and get into Good Trouble! by registerin
 g voters in Yolo County. We will form small teams and rotate to different 
 public places such as laundromats\, big box stores\, parks and bus station
 s. We'll tell people about the national weekend of action to honor voting 
 rights hero John Lewis\, invite people to share their experiences with vot
 ing\, and help them register to vote or change their registration address 
 if needed. Sign up and you will be contacted with detailed instructions 
LOCATION:Yolo County\, Davis\, CA\, 95616
