UID:event_315385707@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260704T034839Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T140000
SUMMARY:Sculptural Papermaking with Bev Barnett
DESCRIPTION:Pence Adult Art Programs\nWith artist Bev Barnett\, embark on 
 a unique adventure to transform ordinary household recycling\, kitchen was
 te\, and foraged botanicals into textured handmade paper that tells a comp
 elling story. In this workshop\, we’ll move beyond the notion that paper
  should be flat\, creating low-relief sculpture and highly textured sheets
 . You’ll master a simple\, low-water method using a household blender to
  macerate pulp and learn how to incorporate color without messy dyes. By t
 he time you leave\, you’ll have 8 to 10 handmade papers\, a blueprint fo
 r your own home studio\, and the confidence to keep creating.\n\nSculptura
 l Papermaking with Bev Barnett\nSaturday\\\, August 22 \\| 10 AM \\- 2 PM\
 n$115 Members\, $125 Non-Members (All materials included)\n\n**Registratio
 n is required through the [Pence's website (CLICK HERE)](https://pencegall
 ery.org/education/programs/workshops-and-classes/).**\n\nAny questions? Em
 ail pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/pence-adult-art-programs/events/31538
 5707/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260623T173405Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260623T173405Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
